WEBVTT

00:14:28.780 --> 00:14:30.365
I think we're going to rise up.

00:14:30.824 --> 00:14:33.994
I think we're going to rekindle
the spirit of optimism.

00:14:34.536 --> 00:14:39.416
It seems to me they underestimated
the resilience of humanity.

00:14:40.709 --> 00:14:42.169
Whose eye is this?

00:14:42.586 --> 00:14:43.962
Someone you love?

00:14:44.296 --> 00:14:45.672
Someone you hate?

00:14:46.340 --> 00:14:51.136
It belongs to a man who was robbed
of the power of human connection.

00:14:52.179 --> 00:14:53.805
Professor Stephen Hawking.

00:14:55.015 --> 00:14:57.476
Now, he was very ill
when I took this picture.

00:14:57.476 --> 00:15:00.520
In fact, his whole body
had essentially shut down.